{{#> layouts/base 
    title="Welcome to MedipointHQ"
    headerIcon="🏥" 
    headerTitle="Welcome to MedipointHQ"
    headerColor="#0284c7"
    buttonColor="#0284c7"
}}

<div class="card">
    <h2>Hello {{patientName}},</h2>
    <p>Welcome to MedipointHQ! We're committed to providing you with high-quality, personalized healthcare.</p>
    <p>🎉 Your secure patient portal account is ready! You can now log in to manage your health information, view appointments, and communicate with your care team from anywhere.</p>
    
    {{> button url=loginUrl text="Log In to Your Account" arrow=true}}
</div>

<div class="card">
    <h3>Get Started</h3>
    <ol>
        <li>Log in to your account</li>
        <li>Complete your health history — fill out your medical intake forms and update your allergies or medications</li>
        <li>Verify your insurance — upload your current insurance card and billing preferences</li>
        {{#if primaryCareProvider}}
        <li>Meet your provider — your care team, led by {{primaryCareProvider}}, is ready to support your health journey</li>
        {{/if}}
    </ol>
</div>

<div class="card">
    <h3>What you can do in your patient portal</h3>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Appointments</strong> — schedule, reschedule, or view upcoming visits</li>
        <li><strong>Secure Messaging</strong> — send direct questions to your doctors and care team</li>
        <li><strong>Medical Records</strong> — access your lab results, imaging reports, and visit summaries</li>
        <li><strong>Prescriptions</strong> — request refills and view your active medications</li>
        <li><strong>Billing & Payments</strong> — view your statements and pay bills securely online</li>
    </ul>
</div>

{{#if appointmentDate}}
<div class="highlight">
    <p><strong>📅 Upcoming Appointment:</strong> {{formatDate appointmentDate 'MMMM Do, YYYY'}}{{#if appointmentTime}} at {{appointmentTime}}{{/if}}</p>
</div>
{{/if}}

<div class="warning">
    <p><strong>⚠️ For urgent medical matters</strong>, please call our office directly. If you are experiencing a life-threatening medical emergency, please contact emergency services immediately.</p>
</div>

{{/layouts/base}}